{
  "about": [
    "Shared test vectors of the phone link's mutual authentication (protocol v3).",
    "proof = base64url(HMAC-SHA256(key = UTF-8 of pairingToken, message = UTF-8 of phoneMessage / hudMessage)), no padding.",
    "certFingerprint = lowercase hex SHA-256 of the TLS certificate (DER) the phone was shown; empty on a plain ws:// session.",
    "certificates: real certificates made by the HUD's generator (hud-server/src/tls/certificate.ts), with their fingerprint and",
    "its short form for people to compare (first 20 hex digits, upper case, groups of four).",
    "Asserted by packages/core/test/protocol/phone-auth.test.ts (messages, short forms), packages/hud-server/test/phone/auth.test.ts",
    "(proofs, fingerprints) and companion-android/protocol (PhoneAuthTest, CertFingerprintTest; ContractSyncTest checks its copy",
    "against this file). Never change a vector: add one."
